### Requests for IntelliJ's HTTP client (or VS Code's REST Client). Start the app first: ./gradlew bootRun
@host = http://localhost:8085

### Book 2 seats: 201 with a Location header
POST {{host}}/events/react-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ana@example.com", "seats": 2}

### Read a booking: copy the id from the Location header above
GET {{host}}/events/react-cluj/bookings/PASTE-THE-BOOKING-ID

### More seats than are free: 409 with availableSeats
POST {{host}}/events/react-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "dan@example.com", "seats": 500}

### Unknown event: 404
POST {{host}}/events/nope/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ana@example.com", "seats": 1}

### Invalid email and zero seats: 400
POST {{host}}/events/react-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "not-an-email", "seats": 0}

### Not JSON: 415
POST {{host}}/events/react-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: text/plain

2 seats please
